      "challenges": [
        "2,621 alerts; 2,539 verified (96.9%), 420 validated suspects, 416 investigated (99.0%), and 241 transferred. Six provinces have numeric alert rows (Haut-Uele, Bas-Uele, Ituri, Nord-Kivu, Sud-Ubangi and Tshopo); Sud-Kivu is unavailable, not zero.",
